{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"26f3cb136d0366e2592a5fd8be2e771a38eed2c883348bfeb2bdfead6fb199f2","digest":{"component_or_area":"criteria eval CLI","key_entities":["src/rebar/_cli/_llm_eval_commands.py","src/rebar/llm/code_review/registry.py","tests/unit/test_code_review_project_criteria.py","code_review.registry.effective_criteria","plan_review.registry.by_id","calibrate_criterion","project.foo"],"problem_keywords":["criteria eval","cli","code-review","plan-review","registry","admission","preflight"],"propositions":["The criteria eval CLI preflight rejects code-review ids as unknown because it only checks the plan-review registry, preventing activated project code-review criteria from reaching the gate-aware eval resolver.","The preflight must be extended to admit code-review ids by looking them up in both plan-review and code-review effective registries and admitting the id if present in exactly one gate.","An id active in both plan-review and code-review gates must be rejected with an ambiguous error message naming both gates; an id in neither must retain the existing unknown error.","The criteria eval help text must be updated to include a concrete project code-review example (project.foo) alongside the plan-review example."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787315928655039001,"uuid":"15fd344c-be51-41a9-acf2-21af7e7a4f02"}